{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:05 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"巴度與太太Eva及一位來自外國的靚女朋友齊齊拉頭馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/f040f69dd1abcafcc1621c70d3def2be/2026-11/m2_6.jpg\"/><p>本月暫舉行過四次谷戰，巴度次次有馬贏，騎者繼上周三取3W後，今晚贏羅廄「天天更好」及甘廄「靖哥哥」起孖；賽後巴度太太Eva與一位來自外國的靚女朋友齊齊拉頭馬，並與巴度擊掌慶祝。</p><p>羅富全說：「『天天更好』今仗形勢較上仗跑泥地好得多。此馬很講求騎師如何拿捏發力點，且與巴度最夾。」<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:24:06.310599+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:05:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:25:16.530870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T15:17:24.829652+00:00","content_hash":"99aa38c3ecfc6832b7649045b6909abf69e717fcafe9fb87b0cda8be68214793","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}